Fixed. The bug was in line 7: `b.url === inc.url` does a case-sensitive string comparison, so `https://example.com/a` ≠ `https://EXAMPLE.com/a`.

Added a `normalizeUrl` helper that uses the `URL` constructor — which lowercases the hostname — to compare URLs case-insensitively. The match check now uses `normalizeUrl(b.url) === normalizeUrl(inc.url)`.


